WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
第 1 集 · 午夜车库
Episode 1 · Midnight Garage

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.450
每个夜晚，他都梦见同一个 看不清脸的女人
Every night, he dreams of a woman whose face he never sees.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.270
每个夜晚……同样的气味，同样的影子。你到底是谁？
Every night... the same scent. The same shadow. Who are you?

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.330
又是那个梦……我大概是最近太累了。
That dream again... I must be more tired than I thought.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.000
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.350
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.070
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:37.625
你：我从地球来的
（实时生成 · 10+10）

00:00:37.725 --> 00:00:42.549
地球。
Earth.

00:00:42.749 --> 00:00:47.573
那地球一直把你藏着，不让我找到。
Then Earth has been hiding you from me.

00:00:49.773 --> 00:00:53.597
你的脉搏跳得好快。我的也是。
Your pulse is racing. So is mine.

00:00:53.797 --> 00:00:57.621
我得确认你是真的。
I need to know you're real.

00:00:57.921 --> 00:01:00.221
你：你想干什么
（实时生成 · 10+10）

00:01:00.321 --> 00:01:05.145
就这样。
Just this.

00:01:05.345 --> 00:01:10.169
碰一下就好。我就知道自己不是在做梦。
One touch. Then I'll know I'm not dreaming.

00:01:12.369 --> 00:01:16.193
三十年，我一直梦见你。
Thirty years I've dreamed of you.

00:01:16.393 --> 00:01:20.217
不在这里。他们来了。跟我走。
Not here. They're coming. Come with me.

00:01:20.317 --> 00:01:22.817
第 2 集 · 车厢里的克制
Episode 2 · The Car

00:01:20.617 --> 00:01:24.537
你：好，我跟你走。但路上，你得把话说清楚。
Fine. I'll come. But you explain on the way.

00:01:26.897 --> 00:01:28.437
开车。
Drive.

00:01:28.517 --> 00:01:31.037
你：你还没告诉我，你到底是什么。
You still haven't told me what you are.

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:34.827
现在，我身上全是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:35.337 --> 00:01:37.647
午夜之前，那家酒店里的每一头狼都会知道。
Every wolf in that hotel will know it by midnight.

00:01:38.577 --> 00:01:40.427
在我的庄园里，没人能碰你。
At my estate, no one can touch you.

00:01:45.297 --> 00:01:47.587
现在别碰我……我会停不下来。
Don't touch me right now… I won't be able to stop.

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:47.877
你：你不会伤害我的。
You won't hurt me.

00:01:48.101 --> 00:01:50.401
你：不碰就不碰
（实时生成 · 10+10）

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:55.325
别赌气。
Don't sulk.

00:01:55.525 --> 00:02:00.349
我信不过的不是你，是我自己。
It's not you I don't trust. It's me.

00:02:02.549 --> 00:02:06.373
碰一下，我就会忘了自己答应过的一切。
One touch and I'd forget every promise I made.

00:02:06.573 --> 00:02:10.397
到了。这是我的领地。
We're here. My territory.

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:12.997
第 3 集 · 他的领地
Episode 3 · His Territory

00:02:20.857 --> 00:02:22.817
是我的气味。在这里，到处都是。
It's my scent. Here, it's everywhere.

00:02:22.897 --> 00:02:25.747
会好的。我……该提前告诉你。
It'll settle. I… should have warned you.

00:02:34.917 --> 00:02:36.487
这里是我的领地。
This is my territory.

00:02:37.377 --> 00:02:38.277
在这里，没人能碰你。
No one touches you here.

00:02:38.357 --> 00:02:40.377
你：你到底还瞒着我什么？
What else are you hiding?

00:02:42.327 --> 00:02:44.567
你们的世界里，只在故事里听过的东西。
Something your world only tells stories about.

00:02:44.647 --> 00:02:48.797
而你……是我本不该找到的那个人。
And you… are the one thing I was never meant to find.

00:02:49.406 --> 00:02:51.706
你：但你还是找上我了
（实时生成 · 10+10）

00:02:51.806 --> 00:02:56.630
是。
I did.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:01.654
而且我还会再找到你。每一次都会。
And I'd find you again. Every time.

00:03:03.854 --> 00:03:07.678
楼上，他们还在等我的答复。
Upstairs, they're still waiting for my answer.

00:03:07.878 --> 00:03:11.702
有人来了。待在我身后。
Someone's here. Stay behind me.

00:03:11.802 --> 00:03:14.302
第 4 集 · 不速之客
Episode 4 · Uninvited

00:03:11.802 --> 00:03:17.282
Arkwright 小姐，他今晚不见任何人。
Miss Arkwright — he's not receiving anyone tonight.

00:03:17.362 --> 00:03:18.452
他会见我的。
He'll receive me.

00:03:26.632 --> 00:03:27.862
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:03:28.912 --> 00:03:36.442
Alpha，Arkwright 小姐来了，她不肯等。
Alpha — Miss Arkwright. She wouldn't wait.

00:03:36.522 --> 00:03:37.372
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:03:38.722 --> 00:03:40.732
她轮不到你过问，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:03:41.762 --> 00:03:43.012
一个人类，Magnus？
A human, Magnus?

00:03:43.622 --> 00:03:45.572
满月之前，长老会会把她带走。
The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.594
你：她说的什么意思
（实时生成 · 10+10）

00:03:50.694 --> 00:03:55.518
意思是，他们知道你了。
It means they know about you.

00:03:55.718 --> 00:04:00.542
长老会会带走一切威胁血脉的东西。
The Council takes whatever threatens the bloodline.

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:06.566
今晚，那就是你。
Tonight, that's you.

00:04:06.766 --> 00:04:10.590
现在你知道我是什么了。你怕我吗？
Now you know what I am. Are you afraid of me?

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:13.190
第 5 集 · 不想逃
Episode 5 · I Don't Want to Run

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:15.710
你：我不是在怕你。
I'm not afraid of you.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.490
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:24.690
你：我只是好奇你和刚才那女的是不是有什么不为人知的往事？
（实时生成 · 10+10）

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:29.614
吃醋了？
Jealous?

00:04:29.814 --> 00:04:34.638
Selene 是我父亲签下的一纸婚约。
Selene was a contract my father signed.

00:04:36.838 --> 00:04:40.662
仅此而已，从来没有别的。
Nothing more. Ever.

00:04:40.862 --> 00:04:44.686
我这辈子找过的，只有一个女人。
There's only one woman I've ever searched for.

00:04:44.986 --> 00:04:47.286
你：你现在看起来不太对劲
（实时生成 · 10+10）

00:04:47.386 --> 00:04:52.210
我是不对劲。
I'm not.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:57.234
忍了三十年。
Thirty years of holding back.

00:04:59.434 --> 00:05:03.258
而你只差一个呼吸的距离。
And you're one breath away.

00:05:03.458 --> 00:05:07.282
今晚，别放开我。
Don't let go of me tonight.

00:05:07.382 --> 00:05:09.882
第 6 集 · 今夜
Episode 6 · Tonight

00:05:14.662 --> 00:05:15.952
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:05:16.032 --> 00:05:18.202
你：我哪儿也不去。
I'm not going anywhere.

00:05:45.466 --> 00:05:47.966
第 7 集 · 长老会
Episode 7 · The Council

00:05:45.466 --> 00:05:48.136
Alpha，Harland 召集了长老。
Alpha. Harland has called the elders.

00:05:48.486 --> 00:05:51.116
他们要你把她交给长老会，就在今晚。
They demand you hand her over to the Council. Tonight.

00:05:53.546 --> 00:05:55.336
那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.050
你：你会怎么对他们说
（实时生成 · 10+10）

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:02.974
实话。
The truth.

00:06:03.174 --> 00:06:07.998
我找到了我的 Mate。
That I found my Mate.

00:06:10.198 --> 00:06:14.022
我不会放手。
And I'm not giving her up.

00:06:14.222 --> 00:06:18.046
不管代价是什么。让他们来试试。
Whatever it costs. Let them try.

00:06:23.206 --> 00:06:27.436
把她交出来，Magnus。族规比你古老。
Hand her over, Magnus. The law is older than you.

00:06:30.396 --> 00:06:34.166
那这条族规，今晚就到此为止。她是我的 Mate。
Then the law ends tonight. She is my Mate.

00:06:34.256 --> 00:06:37.606
那你就是在向自己的血脉宣战。
Then you have declared war on your own blood.

00:06:38.896 --> 00:06:40.106
那就如此。
So be it.

00:06:40.636 --> 00:06:43.836
第一集 · 完 未完待续
Episode 1 · To be continued
